B.L8=s(["Added negative combo multiplier.","Added Crab Scores tab for the negative scores leaderboard.","Added Hall of Famer tab for previous relases top scorers.","Modified Leaderboard to show up to 20 entries","Fixed Gameover screen not showing negative scores","Leaderboard reset.","Fixed audio powers not resuming after a mute and consequentially buggin the powers.","Loaded audio should now play on cue at first play.","Added new Jayat sprite to counter the negative combo multiplier.","Jayat has a flat value of 10. He can spawn from SB19 Stell sprites."],t.s)
